    "updated_at": "2024-11-19T16:06:12Z",
    "body": "Any updates on this PR? It's mildly related to https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10737 inasmuch as the close watcher logic is a little weirder (implementation-wise) when the open attribute can just be yanked off without calling close(). @josepharhar did you happen to try shipping the new behavior to see about web compat? (I'm happy to try, if there's consensus that this PR's behavior is desirable.)",
