    "body": "> @josepharhar did you happen to try shipping the new behavior to see about web compat? (I'm happy to try, if there's consensus that this PR's behavior is desirable.)\r\n\r\nNo, I haven't shipped this yet.\r\n\r\nI'm still waiting for feedback from @smaug---- in this thread: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10124#discussion_r1483640232\r\nIt sounds like posting a task to focus is the right thing to do so far, so perhaps I'll just do that.",
