    "created_at": "2025-01-27T19:25:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-28T13:58:55Z",
    "body": "Are there any updates on this change? It's possible that this is actually required by the spec (and definitely seems to be required by some tests) due to the recent closedby attribute additions.\r\n\r\nSpecifically the assertion on [step 13](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#dom-dialog-showmodal) that the `open dialogs list` doesn't already contain `this` isn't always true without this change.\r\n\r\nEdit: See #10953 and https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10954 for a minimal attempt to fix this issue.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/2616704543/reactions",
