    "created_at": "2025-02-06T23:46:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-06T23:46:45Z",
    "body": "From WHATNOT:\r\n- we should look at popover to decide whether to fire the synchronous beforetoggle event or not in this case (we probably shouldn't)\r\n- there might be some other focus fixup thing that changes the focused element when the open attribute is removed. it might be better to just not focus the previously focused element at all. would also be good to look at popover to see what it does",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
